INSERT INTO public.resource_memory (id, title, summary, resource_type, content, tree_path, last_modify, metadata_, embedding_config, summary_embedding, created_at, updated_at, is_deleted, _created_by_id, _last_updated_by_id, organization_id, user_id) VALUES ('res_ABJX','Amazon EDI Monitoring – Compliance Issues Email','Email regarding compliance issues found in Amazon EDI monitoring, involving multiple stakeholders across companies. Discusses BOL configuration and tracking number issues, with procedural instructions for addressing compliance concerns.','email','Hello Mia, Thank You for the Update. And are the Labels and BOL configured for amazon? Thank you, Best Regards, Rohan Address: 6645 Caballero Blvd., Buena Park, CA 90620 https://link.edgepilot.com/s/70caa2c0/9wytHJeWUEegmECDyDI65Q?u=https://gurunanda.com/ On Mon, Sep 22, 2025 at 9:23 AM Mia Chen <mia.chen@item.com> wrote: Hi Rohan, I have mapped this BOL to the order, and it is intended to be used during the shipping process. Please let me know when new Amazon small parcel orders are imported so I can monitor them closely. Thank you. Sincerely, Mia Chen Beijing, CN Sr. EDI Engineer mia.chen@item.com https://link.edgepilot.com/s/407f1f9a/eYrvDRXv70GtCzjqS1nOAA?u=http://www.item.com/ M: +1 626-781-6193 发件人: Kushgra Srivastava <ksrivastava@spscommerce.com> 发送时间: 2025年9月19日 16:17 收件人: Rohan Suryaneni <rohan@gurunanda.com>; Mia Chen <mia.chen@item.com> 抄送: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; gurunanda.bp@unisco.com <gurunanda.bp@unisco.com>; Mari Mendoza <mari.mendoza@unisco.com>; Rocky Jain <rocky@gurunanda.com>; Pranil Sunil Angawane <pangawane@spscommerce.com>; Payam Shokohi <pshokohi@spscommerce.com>; Margret Ashok-Kumar <margret@gurunanda.com>; EDI UNISCO <edi@unisco.com>; Implementation@item.com <Implementation@item.com>; Neetu Jain <neetu@gurunanda.com> 主题: RE: Amazon EDI Monitoring – Compliance Issues found. Hello @Rohan Suryaneni Greetings! Here is the attached snapshot of Bill of Lading Number being sent on 940 file for the below mentioned order. Unis team can find it in N9*BM segment on 940 file if you are sending the BOL number on 940. Best regards, Kushagra Availability until: 11.30 AM CST(10 PM IST) OOO – 18 September From: Rohan Suryaneni <rohan@gurunanda.com> Sent: 17 September 2025 22:46 To: Mia Chen <mia.chen@item.com>; Kushgra Srivastava <ksrivastava@spscommerce.com> Cc: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; gurunanda.bp@unisco.com; Mari Mendoza <mari.mendoza@unisco.com>; Rocky Jain <rocky@gurunanda.com>; Pranil Sunil Angawane <pangawane@spscommerce.com>; Payam Shokohi <pshokohi@spscommerce.com>; Margret Ashok-Kumar <margret@gurunanda.com>; EDI UNISCO <edi@unisco.com>; Implementation@item.com; Neetu Jain <neetu@gurunanda.com> Subject: Re: Amazon EDI Monitoring – Compliance Issues found. Hello Mia and Kushgra, The Sales Order 3AFKJNVF has been sent to UNIS with a BOL#. Could you please check which field the BOL# is being sent to UNIS? We need to implement logic where: - If we send a BOL#, UNIS should use our BOL# - If no BOL# is sent, then UNIS should default to using their own BOL# Let me know once you''ve reviewed or if you need any more details. Thank You, Best Regards, Rohan Address: 6645 Caballero Blvd., Buena Park, CA 90620 https://link.edgepilot.com/s/70caa2c0/9wytHJeWUEegmECDyDI65Q?u=https://gurunanda.com/ On Mon, Sep 15, 2025 at 2:11 AM Mia Chen <mia.chen@item.com> wrote: Hi Frances @Frances Parro Belleza, Kindly follow up on the request below and let us know once you have an update. Thank you. Sincerely, Mia Chen Beijing, CN Sr. EDI Engineer mia.chen@item.com https://link.edgepilot.com/s/023abb97/J0GQ05fY2Ei0_DcFhzQBsA?u=http://www.item.com/ M: +1 626-781-6193 发件人: Rohan Suryaneni <rohan@gurunanda.com> 发送时间: 2025年9月13日 7:29 收件人: Mia Chen <mia.chen@item.com> 抄送: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; gurunanda.bp@unisco.com <gurunanda.bp@unisco.com>; Mari Mendoza <mari.mendoza@unisco.com>; Rocky Jain <rocky@gurunanda.com>; Pranil Sunil Angawane <pangawane@spscommerce.com>; Payam Shokohi <pshokohi@spscommerce.com>; Margret Ashok-Kumar <margret@gurunanda.com>; EDI UNISCO <edi@unisco.com>; Implementation@item.com <Implementation@item.com>; Neetu Jain <neetu@gurunanda.com> 主题: Re: Amazon EDI Monitoring – Compliance Issues found. Hello Mia, Do we have any Update on this? Thank You, Best Regards, Rohan Address: 6645 Caballero Blvd., Buena Park, CA 90620 https://link.edgepilot.com/s/70caa2c0/9wytHJeWUEegmECDyDI65Q?u=https://gurunanda.com/ On Wed, Sep 10, 2025 at 12:49 PM Rohan Suryaneni <rohan@gurunanda.com> wrote: Hi Mia, We will provide the BOL numbers for the Amazon Small Parcel shipments. For the LTL shipments, please use the UNIS BOL number. UNIS will be responsible for printing the ASN labels. Attached are the ASN label formats (for both carton and pallet labels) and the BOL format for Amazon — please configure them as soon as possible and let me know if you have any questions. Note: GuruNanda will only provide UPS labels if required. Pallet Labeling Instructions: Pallet Label Number = Carrier Pro Number + Pallet ID Pallet ID format: X followed by a 4-digit pallet number. (For example, if the pallet number is 1, the ID should be: X0001, If it''s 12 it should be X0012) You may use the SSCC in place of the Amazon Carrier Code if needed. Example: Pallet One: Carrier Pro: A123456 Pallet ID: X0001 Pallet Label Number: A123456X0001 Pallet Two: Carrier Pro: A123456 Pallet ID: X0002 Pallet Label Number: A123456X0002 You can also refer to the attached sample label for the correct label creation format. Thank You, Best Regards, Rohan Address: 6645 Caballero Blvd., Buena Park, CA 90620 https://link.edgepilot.com/s/70caa2c0/9wytHJeWUEegmECDyDI65Q?u=https://gurunanda.com/ On Wed, Sep 10, 2025 at 9:51 AM Mia Chen <mia.chen@item.com> wrote: Hi Frances and Mari, The ASNs for GuruNanda’s Amazon Small Parcel orders are currently not being sent out due to the lack of tracking numbers. This is because we are not generating the labels—GuruNanda uploads them instead. The GuruNanda team would like to confirm if they can manually enter the tracking numbers after the orders are imported. I’m not certain about the timeframe for them to do so, so I’d appreciate your guidance on this. 😄 Thank you. Sincerely, Mia Chen Beijing, CN Sr. EDI Engineer mia.chen@item.com https://link.edgepilot.com/s/d879a1f5/gcgn_3xsbUm6dKK5ajp2jQ?u=http://www.item.com/ M: +1 626-781-6193 发件人: Rocky Jain <rocky@gurunanda.com> 发送时间: 2025年9月10日 21:34 收件人: Mia Chen <mia.chen@item.com> 抄送: Rohan Suryaneni <rohan@gurunanda.com>; Pranil Sunil Angawane <pangawane@spscommerce.com>; Payam Shokohi <pshokohi@spscommerce.com>; Margret Ashok-Kumar <margret@gurunanda.com>; EDI UNISCO <edi@unisco.com>; Implementation@item.com <Implementation@item.com> 主题: Re: Amazon EDI Monitoring – Compliance Issues found. can you use so number as bol number from our order file for small parcel orders or can we go in wise system to enter the tracking number. Warm Regards Rocky Jain VP of Operations Warehouse, Logistics, and Customer Service Gurunanda LLC 6645 Caballero Blvd. Buena Park , CA 90620 Cell: 7142326884 On Wed, Sep 10, 2025 at 3:15 AM Mia Chen <mia.chen@item.com> wrote: Hi Rocky, This is caused by the same reason as 1X8JT9EV. The BOL is missing because this is a small parcel order. Normally, in this scenario, we can use the tracking number in place of the BOL. However, since the label was provided by Guru Nanda, the tracking number was not generated by our system, and therefore we could not capture it in the 945. Could you please advise how you would like us to handle this situation? Sincerely, Mia Chen Beijing, CN Sr. EDI Engineer mia.chen@item.com https://link.edgepilot.com/s/0d03d5db/gtji2HhFs0u9XwxJ-3LQtQ?u=http://www.item.com/ M: +1 626-781-6193 发件人: Rocky Jain <rocky@gurunanda.com> 发送时间: 2025年9月10日 9:25 收件人: Mia Chen <mia.chen@item.com>; Yamy Liu <yamy.liu@item.com>; Rohan Suryaneni <rohan@gurunanda.com>; Pranil Sunil Angawane <pangawane@spscommerce.com>; Payam Shokohi <pshokohi@spscommerce.com> 抄送: Margret Ashok-Kumar <margret@gurunanda.com> 主题: Fwd: Amazon EDI Monitoring – Compliance Issues found. All ASNs are getting returned. Rocky Jain VP of Operations Customer Service, Logistics and Warehousing. Cell: 7142326884 ---------- Forwarded message --------- From: Amazon Vendor Central <donotreply@amazon.com> Date: Tue, Sep 9, 2025 at 2:11 PM Subject: Amazon EDI Monitoring – Compliance Issues found. To: <rocky@gurunanda.com> Vendor code: ${businessName} Business Validation Failure Visit Vendor Central to resolve the errors Hello, We recently received an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) Advance Shipment Notification document from you on 2025-09-09T21:10:52Z. While processing the file, we found compliance issues that need your attention. Please review the following information below and take any required actions. === Metadata of the EDI Message === Type Value FILEO372E18261B33C944972857652A3FBF31.dat PurchaseOrderNumber 8L9KXWEB TransmissionControlNumber 100003409 PurchaseOrderNumber 8L9KXWEB TransmissionControlNumber 100003409 FILE 20250909-211055369-GUS5Z-2759307-US-ad2f2c18-9cd1-42de-bc32-a37dba3d6c25.ASN.xml FILEO372E18261B33C944972857652A3FBF31.dat You can analyze all transmissions in detail using the Operational Analytics dashboard, accessible in Vendor Central by selecting “Integration (EDI/API)” and then “Operational analytics.” You can verify the receipt or delivery of transmissions, review failed transmissions, and request re-delivery of transmissions from Amazon. === Required Action(s): === Issue # Severity Description Actions 1 The ASN 2759307 does not include a Bill of Lading number Correct and resend your ASN with a unique BOL#. All TL/LTL shipments require a unique BOL number to be listed at the shipment level. Correct and resend your ASN to include the BOL number in the (REF-BM) segment. The BOL should match the same BOL listed by your carrier. Best Regards, https://link.edgepilot.com/s/6e81b1e1/ArUFYlR9gUeYnc0AvcFxow?u=http://www.amazon.com/ EDI Monitoring Amazon reference: 2708ffdc-0b7b-4212-9c64-1300b02051f4-20250909211052 Was this email helpful? If you have any questions visit: Vendor Central To change your email preferences visit: Notification Preferences Copyright 2025 Amazon, Inc, or its affiliates. All rights reserved. SPC-USAmazon-1143494233948416','["work", "internal_communications", "compliance"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T09:38:18.038420+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "embedding_chunk_size": 8191, "handle": null, "azure_endpoint": null, "azure_version": null, "azure_deployment": null}','[-0.014339752,-0.0110352,-0.013952551,-0.015848497,-0.0070096552,0.02037473,-0.010461076,-0.011348966,-0.010087227,-0.012490538,0.020788634,-0.023098482,0.0057412414,0.008812138,-0.01463349,0.00012141724,0.016409269,-0.017824551,0.011989848,0.018598951,-0.045796413,0.0067392825,-0.026970482,0.035515584,-0.011989848,-0.021563035,0.026236137,-0.026356302,-0.0072833654,-0.0069295447,0.008044413,-0.0071431724,-0.016008716,0.013371752,-0.021456221,0.0057712826,0.02827895,0.00835818,0.01327829,0.012250206,0.027424442,0.02447371,-0.0055443035,0.0039020414,-0.008157903,0.024433656,0.02106902,-0.025888992,-0.022203917,0.025421683,0.024260083,0.0011090275,-0.0022848137,-0.009065821,0.0166496,0.02253771,-0.0029740965,0.019667089,-0.005704524,-0.0019944138,-0.0024834205,-0.003818593,-0.012203475,-0.012136717,-0.015608165,-0.01037429,-0.013011255,0.021522978,0.0062152273,-0.02663669,0.031162923,0.013064662,0.007016331,0.00014290518,0.011936441,-0.0004245431,-0.018919393,-0.008424938,0.011175393,-0.0085451035,-0.0019042896,0.0046697655,0.0023899586,0.024607228,0.016222345,-0.012403752,-0.009700027,-0.0018775861,-0.012770924,0.0020044276,-0.0066925515,-0.00090708275,0