 Amazon. === Required Action(s): === Issue # Severity Description Actions 1 There is a mismatch between the License Plate (SSCC) : 008460420505792301 on your physical label and those provided in your ASN : DNUS5082700269 Don''t resend the ASN ID DNUS5082700269 as this shipment has already arrived at our facility. For all future shipments, ensure the SSCC on your physical labels match exactly with those provided in the ASN. Best Regards, www.amazon.com EDI Monitoring Amazon reference: d68100f8-2a81-4ec3-83fb-291c8e674087-20250911152737 Was this email helpful? If you have any questions visit: Vendor Central To change your email preferences visit: Notification Preferences Copyright 2025 Amazon, Inc, or its affiliates. All rights reserved. SPC-USAmazon-1864773865995000','["Internal Business Communication", "Project Updates"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T15:54:06.216850+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "embedding_chunk_size": 8191, "handle": null, "azure_endpoint": null, "azure_version": null, "azure_deployment": null}','[-0.008135684,0.0037121647,-0.016368058,-0.012293308,-0.03160347,0.028979057,-0.009565299,-0.005494004,0.020746686,-0.03607879,0.013073727,-0.0020839921,0.001446881,-0.0021789544,-0.00013672421,0.004910417,0.027929291,0.0012716323,-0.005020919,0.007672958,-0.04304039,0.0012491866,-0.011768426,0.012611001,0.0090335095,0.0004566826,0.004810275,-0.020152738,-0.015428793,-0.013260198,0.009268326,-0.014461904,-0.023412537,0.012293308,-0.025539694,0.0074657677,0.004768837,-0.02439324,0.026865713,-0.02439324,0.022348959,0.016975816,0.0055872397,0.0067060688,0.0071895136,0.028951433,-0.005300626,-0.015677422,-0.011989429,0.01873003,0.038979456,-0.017997956,-0.016478559,-0.002964552,0.009068042,0.014434278,0.001534937,0.024531366,-0.008349781,-0.0005266094,-0.0068545556,0.011160667,-0.028702803,0.0114023