INSERT INTO public.resource_memory (id, title, summary, resource_type, content, tree_path, last_modify, metadata_, embedding_config, summary_embedding, created_at, updated_at, is_deleted, _created_by_id, _last_updated_by_id, organization_id, user_id) VALUES ('res_L1LO','UCC Labels Upload Issue - Wise System','Email thread regarding the urgent issue of UCC labels not uploading into the Wise system affecting shipping and order processing. The discussion involves logistics and IT support teams working to resolve the issue promptly to meet shipping deadlines. The email contains detailed correspondence among team members at SMEG USA, Unisco, and ITEM, emphasizing the need for immediate resolution and the workaround plans put in place.','email','Hi Frances, Attached are the shipping labels I need uploaded. Thank you Sandy From: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@unisco.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 2:04 PMTo: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; Wise Support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>; Austin Steigerwalt <austin.steigerwalt@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>Subject: Re: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Sandra, You can provide all to us and we will upload it on our end for now. Frances BellezaIT Systems Support ManagerPhone: 626.342.4836Email: frances.belleza@item.comWebsite: www.item.com From: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 12:54 PMTo: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@unisco.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; Wise Support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com <smegnorthampton@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>; Austin Steigerwalt <austin.steigerwalt@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Frances, I have attached the shipping labels for 1 PO for you. Let me know if you need more and I will send them over. From: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 1:52 PMTo: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@unisco.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>; Austin Steigerwalt <austin.steigerwalt@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>Subject: Re: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT I think we have two issues here: Can''t upload the labels. - I will look into this, can you provide us the labels for 1 order, and we will try on our end? Thank you! Can''t print the labels using small parcel in WISE 3.0. -This should be fixed. Frances BellezaIT Systems Support ManagerPhone: 626.342.4836Email: frances.belleza@item.comWebsite: www.item.com From: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 12:49 PMTo: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@unisco.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com <smegnorthampton@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>; Austin Steigerwalt <austin.steigerwalt@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Frances, I just tried to upload a shipping label and it is not working. Sandy From: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 1:46 PMTo: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@unisco.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>; Austin Steigerwalt <austin.steigerwalt@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>Subject: Re: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT @Austin Steigerwalt @Brielle Enz-Meltz, Can you guys try now? Let me know, please, thank you! Frances BellezaIT Systems Support ManagerPhone: 626.342.4836Email: frances.belleza@item.comWebsite: www.item.com From: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@unisco.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 12:25 PMTo: Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com <smegnorthampton@unisco.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>; Austin Steigerwalt <austin.steigerwalt@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>Subject: Re: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Vanessa, Do we have the full list or the retailers which you''ve uploaded labels for? We will work on fixing the orders 1 by 1. Frances BellezaIT Systems Support ManagerPhone: 626.342.4836Email: frances.belleza@item.comWebsite: www.item.com From: Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 12:12 PMTo: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@unisco.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Wise Support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com <smegnorthampton@unisco.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>; Austin Steigerwalt <austin.steigerwalt@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi, That is only 1 order we provided as an example.We have about ~100 orders we need to drop with labels… Thanks, Vanessa PatroneLogistics ManagerSMEG USA, Inc.www.smegusa.com From: Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 1:10 PMTo: Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Wise Support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>; Austin Steigerwalt <austin.steigerwalt@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>Subject: Re: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Vanessa, Apologies for the delay, we will do a workaround for now. Hi @Brielle Enz-Meltz @Austin Steigerwalt, Manually print the labels for now and close the order. Frances BellezaIT Systems Support ManagerPhone: 626.342.4836Email: frances.belleza@item.comWebsite: www.item.com From: Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 11:18 AMTo: Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Wise Support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com <smegnorthampton@unisco.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: Re: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Vanessa / team, Apologies for the late revert. We''re still working on fixing this issue at the moment and is waiting feedback from our team. Will keep you posted once resolved so you can process as normal. Hoping for your kind understanding on this. Thanks, Veronica Eve Dae "Vee" SerraSr. Scrum MasterPhone: +63917-179-0119Email: veronica.serra@item.comWebsite: www.item.com From: Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 9:05 AMTo: Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com <smegnorthampton@unisco.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>; Peter Gerike <peter.gerike@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hello – please provide an update.We have a lot of drop ship orders that have now missed the SLA cutoff… @Peter Gerike please help escalade this and get us a response. Thanks, Vanessa PatroneLogistics ManagerSMEG USA, Inc.www.smegusa.com From: Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 11:02 AMTo: Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com>; Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT @Veronica Eve Serra any update here? Thanks, Vanessa PatroneLogistics ManagerSMEG USA, Inc.www.smegusa.com From: Sona Street <sona.street@SMEGUSA.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 10:29 AMTo: Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi all, This is the Error I’m seeing when trying to upload a shipping label. Each time. The number of Tracking No. 0 not match with shipping label number 1. (Request ID: 7370a3625c5e556c51c2231e464022a7) Best regards, Sona StreetLogistics CoordinatorSMEG USA, Inc. OFFICE:590 Belleville TurnpikeBuilding #1 | Kearny, NJ 07032 SHOWROOM:150 East 58th Street – 7th FloorSuite 762 | New York, NY 10155 P Please consider the environment before printing this e-mail From: Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 10:19 AMTo: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Any update?We need to get these orders in before 11 to make the SLA cut off. Thanks, Vanessa PatroneLogistics ManagerSMEG USA, Inc.www.smegusa.com From: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 9:53 AMTo: Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Attached UCC and Shipping label From: Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 9:51 AMTo: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: Re: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Sandra / Vanessa, Can you also send over a sample UCC label that you''re uploading? Thanks,Vee From: Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 9:48:03 AMTo: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com <smegnorthampton@unisco.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: Re: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Sandra, Thanks for that. We are checking from our end and will let you know once we get an update. Thanks,Vee From: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 9:43:48 AMTo: Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com>; Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com <smegnorthampton@unisco.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT You don''t often get email from sandra.jimmerson@smegusainc.onmicrosoft.com. Learn why this is important Hi Veronica, See below for DN DN 1121994 From: Veronica Eve Serra <veronica.serra@item.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 9:41 AMTo: Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>; Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: Re: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT Hi Vanessa, Acknowledging this report. Can you provide a sample DN so we can take a deeper look into this? I''m having our team check this and will let you know any updates we have. Thanks,Vee From: Vanessa Patrone <Vanessa.Patrone@SMEGUSA.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 9:27:05 AMTo: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.com <smegnorthampton@unisco.com>; Frances Parro Belleza <frances.belleza@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo - Unisco <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com>Cc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT You don''t often get email from vanessa.patrone@smegusa.com. Learn why this is important @Frances Parro Belleza @Jennifer Kuo Can you please urgently look into this?We cannot upload UCC labels or shipping labels.This is effecting all our orders we NEED to ship today. Thanks, Vanessa PatroneLogistics ManagerSMEG USA, Inc.www.smegusa.com From: Sandra Jimmerson <Sandra.Jimmerson@SMEGUSAinc.onmicrosoft.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 9:25 AMTo: Wise Support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.comCc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>; Brielle Enz-Meltz <brielle.enz-meltz@unisco.com>Subject: RE: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENT This is also affecting Shipping Labels. From: Sandra Jimmerson Sent: Tuesday, September 23, 2025 9:00 AMTo: Wise Support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; smegnorthampton@unisco.comCc: Abdul Jalil Amin <abdul.amin@unisco.com>; Logistics <Logistics@smegusa.com>Subject: UCC Labels not uploading into Wise URGENTImportance: High Hi Wise Support Team, When we are uploading UCC Labels in Wise they are not generating. The BOLs are fine it seems to be just the UCC labels that are not 