25 5:13 PM To: Lily Choi <lilyc@planaheadnow.com>; edi <edi@item.com>; Sai Sathvik Karla <sai.karla@item.com> Cc: planahead.innovation@unisco.com; Bill Gilbert <bgilbert@estream.com> Subject: RE: OTIF Performance Summary @Sai Sathvik Karla, would you please check for Plan Ahead when we transmitted 856s for POs 1096874, 0517295 & 1105494? Thank you. Jennifer Kuo Account Implementation Manager | IT - Implementation CA, USA | PST mobile: 657 – 705 - 7549 jennifer.kuo@item.com | jennifer.kuo@unisco.com item.com | unisco.com From: Lily Choi <lilyc@planaheadnow.com> Sent: Monday, September 22, 2025 2:39 PM To: EDI ITEM <edi@item.com> Cc: planahead.innovation@unisco.com; Bill Gilbert <bgilbert@estream.com> Subject: FW: OTIF Performance Summary Importance: High Hello, See attached we received chargeback for missing ASNs on POs 1096874, 0517295 & 1105494. Can you please confirm ASNs were sent within 24 hours of order shipping? Thanks From: cvssupplychainperformance@traversesystems.com <cvssupplychainperformance@traversesystems.com> Sent: Monday, September 22, 2025 3:37 AM To: Lily Choi <lilyc@planaheadnow.com> Subject: OTIF Performance Summary Dear Vendor Partner, Please review the attached Performance Summary. This report lists all PO(s) analyzed exclusively for OTIF compliance within the previous week. The PO(s) listed on this report did not necessarily generate OTIF charges. Prior to reporting, the PO(s) may have been flagged for exemption or the charge was deemed invalid. If any PO(s) listed on this report generated chargeable OTIF expense offsets, you will receive a second email containing the Weekly Compliance Summary. This summary contains a list of chargeable noncompliant PO(s) for OTIF, Small Parcel and ASN, including Charge Dates, Charge Numbers and Charge Amounts. Please refer to the Weekly Compliance Summary and review the charge details in the Traverse Portal at auth.traversesystems.com. Charges will transmit for AP processing the Thursday after the Charge Date. Disputes must be submitted within the Traverse Portal no later than 45 days after the transmit date. Informational and educational resources and portal utilization guides are available in the Traverse Portal. Click on the Learning Center in the toolbar and choose Information & Documents. Please do not reply to this email. If you have any questions or concerns, please contact the Supply Chain Performance team at SupplyChainPerformance@cvshealth.com. © 2025 Traverse Systems Replying to this message will send an email to supplychainperformance@cvshealth.com.','["work", "delivery_failures", "system_auto_replies"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T09:10:17.286846+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "embedding_chunk_size": 8191, "handle": null, "azure_endpoint": null, "azure_version": null, "azure_deployment": null}','[-0.02748336,-0.015955849,-0.012911367,-0.02403756,-0.012081054,0.02021812,-0.033959802,0.014779571,-0.025781218,-0.0276771,0.038886324,0.0022487643,0.01288369,0.0003589374,-0.0018751235,-0.0051029655,0.009776936,0.0014392092,0.0068985173,0.018086985,-0.054551564,0.030500164,-0.028922569,0.020481054,0.017533442,-0.028867215,0.0057499176,-0.029060954,-0.023013508,-0.014239868,-0.0036983525,-0.0015257001,-0.014862603,-0.014253707,-0.036699835,-0.016564744,0.006040527,-0.021311367,0.03196705,0.010987809,0.025587479,0.028618122,0.0026794893,0.015886655,0.006908896,0.011700494,0.01880659,-0.00090123556,-0.006272323,0.0059159803,0.017298188,-0.0030116145,0.0008156095,-0.00925107,0.013589456,0.0077634268,-0.006746293,0.008393081,-0.0023369852,0.00065992586,0.0025791598,-0.010773311,-0.014475123,-0.0024978584,-0.025116969,-0.01707677,0.0026760297,0.012620757,-0.019014169,0.001088056,0.032409884,0.027331136,-0.028313674,-0.00028433895,0.026929818,-0.018931136,-0.0074658976,0.001985832,0.0054039536,-0.01021977,0.005