INSERT INTO public.resource_memory (id, title, summary, resource_type, content, tree_path, last_modify, metadata_, embedding_config, summary_embedding, created_at, updated_at, is_deleted, _created_by_id, _last_updated_by_id, organization_id, user_id) VALUES ('res_A8DE','Michaels Shipment Load Issues Email','Email discussing missing routing request numbers and load identifier issues for Michaels'' shipments. It includes detailed shipment data and correspondence between Kenneth Booc and Bill Solano regarding EDI and ASN issues.','email','Hello Bill, Do you have another identifier? These 3 have another load with the same identifier and the weight also doesn’t match to any even if I based it to Michaels BOL. Below are the loads of the SOs you provided, not sure which one is for which. SO217711 BOL: 00814854018540004 Tracking Number: 201573 Weight: 14,244.01 Wise Load ID Michaels Load M BOL Pro/Tracking # Weight LOAD-201574 7260493 00814854018540004 <blank> 7554.8 LOAD-201573 7260492 00814854018530005 201573 16563.4 SO217715 BOL: 00814854017970000 Tracking Number: 201752 Weight: 11,045.158 SO217715 BOL: 00814854017970000 Tracking Number: 201752 Weight: 14,910.434 Wise Load ID Michaels Load M BOL Pro/Tracking # Weight LOAD-201753 7260491 00814854017970000 7260491-SPBOL 19,305.4 LOAD-201752 7260545 00814854017970000 201752 13,694.2 LOAD-201751 7260512 00814854017970000 7260512 6,069.0 LOAD-201750 7260494 00814854017970000 201750 12,191.9 Best regards, Kenneth Joseph Booc UF – Routing Support Phone: +1626 626 8587 Ext. 7252 Email: router31@unisco.com Facility: 2677 E Alessandro Blvd., Riverside, CA, 92508 Website: www.unisco.com From: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com> Sent: Friday, September 19, 2025 7:01 AM To: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com>; Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com; Silvia Sanchez <silvia.sanchez@unisco.com>; Maria Gutierrez <maria.gutierrez@unisco.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com> Cc: Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com>; Michelle Marshall <Michelle.Marshall@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: [External] RE: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels Hi Kenneth, Another Michaels shipment missing the load number. SO217711 BOL: 00814854018540004 Tracking Number: 201573 Weight: 14,244.01 Thanks, ​​​​Bill Solano Sr. EDI Technical Specialist From: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com> Sent: Thursday, September 18, 2025 12:02 PM To: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com>; Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com; Silvia Sanchez <silvia.sanchez@unisco.com>; Maria Gutierrez <maria.gutierrez@unisco.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com> Cc: Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com>; Michelle Marshall <Michelle.Marshall@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: [External] RE: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels Hello Bill, I’m not sure on who puts the MBOL and pro# since I only get the load and pdf BOL from Michaels and I don’t see MBOL # on the portal or on the BOL generated. It might change once the load has been shipped. I will ask for the clarification on load 7260550 since it was supposedly ship out on 9/16 1300. Best regards, Kenneth Joseph Booc UF – Routing Support Phone: +1626 626 8587 Ext. 7252 Email: router31@unisco.com Facility: 2677 E Alessandro Blvd., Riverside, CA, 92508 Website: www.unisco.com From: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com> Sent: Thursday, September 18, 2025 8:49 AM To: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com; Silvia Sanchez <silvia.sanchez@unisco.com>; Maria Gutierrez <maria.gutierrez@unisco.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com> Cc: Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com>; Michelle Marshall <Michelle.Marshall@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: [External] RE: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels Hi Barry, Can you clarify which of these I should use? I only have one Shipment in BC for this? 40271568 SO217712 7260548 00814854018590009 Arrive Logistics 7260547 00814854018590009 Arrive Logistics 7260546 Arrive Logistics 7260489 00814854018370007 Arrive Logistics Thanks ​​​​Bill Solano Sr. EDI Technical Specialist From: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com> Sent: Thursday, September 18, 2025 11:43 AM To: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com>; Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com; Silvia Sanchez <silvia.sanchez@unisco.com>; Maria Gutierrez <maria.gutierrez@unisco.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com> Cc: Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com>; Michelle Marshall <Michelle.Marshall@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: [External] RE: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels Bill, I believe the load number that shipped yesterday for SO217714 was 7260551. Or at least that is what I can deduct from Wise. This is also the only one with a Pro # currently. @Kenneth Booc – If you have 3 loads for a PO why are they sharing the same MBOL number? These should be 3 separate shipments with their own BOLs and packing lists. Are you using Michaels supplied BOLs for these shipments? Can you confirm only one shipment has loaded for SO217714? Thanks, ​​​​Barry Vinot Supply Chain Planner From: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com> Sent: Thursday, September 18, 2025 11:37 AM To: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com; Silvia Sanchez <silvia.sanchez@unisco.com>; Maria Gutierrez <maria.gutierrez@unisco.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com> Cc: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com>; Michelle Marshall <Michelle.Marshall@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: [External] RE: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels Hello Bill, Kindly see table below. Currently these are the only identifiers that are available in our end. PO # Ref. # Load # MBOL Pro # Carrier 40271570 SO217714 7260555 00814854015900009 Arrive Logistics 7260551 00814854015900009 201580 Arrive Logistics 7260550 00814854015900009 Arrive Logistics 40271568 SO217712 7260548 00814854018590009 Arrive Logistics 7260547 00814854018590009 Arrive Logistics 7260546 Arrive Logistics 7260489 00814854018370007 Arrive Logistics Best regards, Kenneth Joseph Booc UF – Routing Support Phone: +1626 626 8587 Ext. 7252 Email: router31@unisco.com Facility: 2677 E Alessandro Blvd., Riverside, CA, 92508 Website: www.unisco.com From: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com> Sent: Thursday, September 18, 2025 8:12 AM To: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com; Silvia Sanchez <silvia.sanchez@unisco.com>; Maria Gutierrez <maria.gutierrez@unisco.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com> Cc: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com>; Michelle Marshall <Michelle.Marshall@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: [External] RE: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels Hi Kenneth, I provided the BOL and tracking data to be able to identify which of these belong to the specific shipment as that’s what I need to provide on the ASN to be compliant. Please clarify. Thanks ​​​​Bill Solano Sr. EDI Technical Specialist From: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com> Sent: Thursday, September 18, 2025 11:04 AM To: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com; Silvia Sanchez <silvia.sanchez@unisco.com>; Maria Gutierrez <maria.gutierrez@unisco.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com> Cc: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com>; Michelle Marshall <Michelle.Marshall@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: [External] RE: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels Hello Bill, Kindly see below. PO # Ref. # Load # 40271570 SO217714 7260555 7260551 7260550 40236788 SO217470 7266781 40236786 SO217474 7266779 40259303 SO217720 7261983 40236789 SO217476 7266782 40271568 SO217712 7260548 7260547 7260546 7260489 Best regards, Kenneth Joseph Booc UF – Routing Support Phone: +1626 626 8587 Ext. 7252 Email: router31@unisco.com Facility: 2677 E Alessandro Blvd., Riverside, CA, 92508 Website: www.unisco.com From: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com> Sent: Thursday, September 18, 2025 5:56 AM To: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com; Silvia Sanchez <silvia.sanchez@unisco.com>; Maria Gutierrez <maria.gutierrez@unisco.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@unisco.com> Cc: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com>; Michelle Marshall <Michelle.Marshall@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: [External] RE: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels Hello @Kenneth Booc, Additional 945 for Micheals missing Routing Request Number SO217714, BOL – 00814854015900009 tracking Number 201580 SO217470, BOL – 00814854011100007 tracking number 201910 SO217474, BOL – 00814854011080002 tracking number 201908 SO217476, BOL – 00814854011010009 tracking number 201911 SO217720, BOL – 00814854011060004 tracking number 201506 SO217712, BOL – 00814854018590009 tracking number 00814854018590009 @edi please let me know how this going to be resolved in the future, there a lot of manual effort required on both sides to correct these issues. Thanks, ​​​​Bill Solano Sr. EDI Technical Specialist From: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com> Sent: Wednesday, September 17, 2025 12:15 PM To: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com; Silvia Sanchez <silvia.sanchez@unisco.com>; Maria Gutierrez <maria.gutierrez@unisco.com> Cc: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com> Subject: [External] RE: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels/Amazon Hello @Silvia/@Maria, I would like to request assistance on the ASN issues with the Lumistella loads. It seems that the load # and ARN does not reflect on the ASN. I did add the ARNs on the DN level and load level but they still cannot see it on their end. Hello @Bill, Kindly see ARNs for the below SOs Michaels: SO217711 – 7260493; 7260492 SO217719 – 7260493 SO217715 – 7260491; 7260545; 7260512; 7260494 SO217709 – 7260557; 7260556; 7260552 SO217710 – 7260554; 7260553; 7260549 Amazon: SO217356 – 37996943241 SO217364 – 37997034941 SO217370 – 37997072721 SO217366 – 37997036801 Best regards, Kenneth Joseph Booc UF – Routing Support Phone: +1626 626 8587 Ext. 7252 Email: router31@unisco.com Facility: 2677 E Alessandro Blvd., Riverside, CA, 92508 Website: www.unisco.com From: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com> Sent: Tuesday, September 16, 2025 5:28 PM To: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com Cc: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com> Subject: Additional missing routing request numbers for Michaels/Amazon Hi @Kenneth Booc, Some additional missing Routing Request for Michaels and ARN’s for Amazon. The missing data is delaying the send of the ASNs and could cause potential chargebacks. Michaels: SO217711 SO217719 SO217715 SO217709 SO217710 Amazon: SO217356 SO217364 SO217370 SO217366 Thanks, ​​​​Bill Solano Sr. EDI Technical Specialist From: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com> Sent: Monday, September 15, 2025 9:58 AM To: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com Cc: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: missing routing request numbers for Michaels Hi @Kenneth Booc, Any update on the missing Michaels load numbers? Thanks ​​​​Bill Solano Sr. EDI Technical Specialist From: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com> Sent: Saturday, September 13, 2025 11:43 AM To: Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com Cc: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com> Subject: RE: missing routing request numbers for Michaels Hi Team, These are for SO217715 and SO217718 with External Tracking Number 7260512. Thanks ​​​​Bill Solano Sr. EDI Technical Specialist From: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com> Sent: Saturday, September 13, 2025 11:17 AM To: Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com>; Kenneth Booc <router31@unisco.com>; lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com Cc: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com> Subject: Re: missing routing request numbers for Michaels Adding @Kenneth Booc @lumistella.alessandro@unisco.com -Unis team please provide the Michaels load number for these two shipments. Get Outlook for iOS ​​​​Barry Vinot Supply Chain Planner From: Charles Ruark <charles.ruark@lumistella.com> Sent: Saturday, September 13, 2025 7:20:53 AM To: Barry Vinot <Barry.Vinot@lumistella.com>; Pierre Pettigrew <pierre.pettigrew@lumistella.com> Cc: Bill Solano <Bill.Solano@lumistella.com> Subject: missing routing request numbers for Michaels 2 more missing RRN for these 2 BC BOL #s…can we get to the bottom of this, why sometimes we get it and sometimes not? ​​​​Charles Ruark Interim VP of Business Systems 3350 Riverwood Parkway SE, Suite 300 | Atlanta, GA 30339 770‑701‑6157 x 9244 charles.ruark@lumistella.com The information in this email and any files transmitted with it may include confidential information and are intended solely for the use of the individual(s) to whom are addressed in the email. It is not the intention of CCA and B, LLC d/b/a The Lumistella Company (the “Company” or “The Lumistella Company”) to transmit trade secrets to unauthorized recipients. To the extent a Company trade secret has been so transmitted, it is inadvertent and strictly prohibited. Unauthorized review, forwarding, printing, copying, distribution, or use of any such information in this email is prohibited and may be unlawful. If you have received this email in error, please notify the sender and delete this email from your system. Any views or opinions presented in this email are those of the sender and do not necessarily represent those of the Company. Email transmission cannot be guaranteed to be secure or error-free as information could be intercepted, corrupted, lost, destroyed, arrive late or incomplete, or contain viruses. The Company accepts no liability for the content of this email, or for the consequences of any actions taken on the basis of the information provided, unless that information is subsequently confirmed in writing. Nothing in this message is intended to constitute an Electronic signature for purposes of the Uniform Electronic Transactions Act (UETA) or the Electronic Signatures in Global and National Commerce Act ("E-Sign") unless a specific statement to the contrary is included in this message.','["work", "industry_reports", "thought_leadership", "executive_insights"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T11:17:35.733756+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embed