o import as code LPS600 is not yet setup in our XREF table.Please confirm whether this will be mapped as B2B or B2C. Thank you! Regards, Alfred GarciaEDI AnalystBuena Park, CA | PSTalfred.garcia@item.com | www.item.com From: Ivan Chiu <Ivan.Chiu@segproducts.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 16, 2025 8:02 PMTo: Alfred Garcia <alfred.garcia@item.com>Cc: Vivian He <Vivian.He@segproducts.com>; Hong Chan <Hong.Chan@segproducts.com>; Alondra Toledano <alondra.toledano@unisco.com>; ''segproducts.airport@unisco.com'' <segproducts.airport@unisco.com>Subject: Re: LPS600 PO 4609749-00 Dear Alfred Would you please check why below order cannot be imported to WISE ? ORD1294974 Ivan ChiuAnalyste de données des opérations de vente/Sales Operations, Data Analyst1175 Place du Frère André, Montreal, QC, H3B 3X9D: 514-227-7885 T: 514-383-4720,212 From: Vivian He <Vivian.He@segproducts.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 16, 2025 10:55 PMTo: Ivan Chiu <Ivan.Chiu@segproducts.com>; Hong Chan <Hong.Chan@segproducts.com>Subject: RE: LPS600 PO 4609749-00 Hello Hong, I don’t see this PO in UNIS for item 11487. Can you please advise how to fix it? Thank you. Vivian HeCoordinatrice des opérations de vente/Sales Operations, Coordinator1175 Place du Frère André, Montreal, QC, H3B 3X9D: 514-227-7870 T: 514-383-4720,286','["work", "internal_business_communication", "project_updates"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T13:22:46.859307+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "embedding_chunk_size": 8191, "handle": null, "azure_endpoint": null, "azure_version": null, "azure_deployment": null}','[0.009982492,0.007310665,-0.01458537,0.012075363,-0.033083186,0.012665107,-0.0145997545,-0.0019166672,-0.007853661,-0.022712328,-0.0030943567,-0.0033784406,0.01602377,0.0107879955,-0.014858666,0.01508881,0.0035043005,-0.02553159,0.02812071,0.0020641033,-0.004714354,-0.01937524