fred.garcia@item.com | www.item.com From: Leticia Oropeza <Leticia.Oropeza@drinkorgain.com> Sent: Friday, September 12, 2025 12:09 PM To: Alfred Garcia <alfred.garcia@item.com>; Susan Mendez <susan.mendez@unisco.com>; Andrei Simon <router39@unisco.com>; Brittany Wagner <Brittany.Wagner@drinkorgain.com> Cc: Daniel Blanco <Daniel.Blanco@drinkorgain.com>; Brendon Greeley <Brendon.Greeley@drinkorgain.com>; EDI Support <EDI.support@drinkorgain.com>; Dynnah Delamora <Dynnah.Delamora@drinkorgain.com>; jonathan.white <jonathan.white@unisco.com>; edi <edi@item.com> Subject: Re: Amazon- Missing ASN Chargebacks Hi Team, Please see latest updates from our call regarding these ASN''s. @Alfred Garcia, please provide and update on the two orders below as soon as possible. 3IZ3EMTZ – one shipment did not get an ASN à Checking 36XKU9HX – B00BKL4KKY not on ASN à Checking 3TR9D5OB – no ASN received à Sent and acknowledged > Confirming 945 was recieved and this was an SPS error 6A1HBXMK - B00JTX7SHC & B01CI57UD4 not on ASN à Still in partial shipped status in WISE Mult Truck shipment- one ASN missing> @Susan Mendez @Andrei Simon, Status was previously in transit and now showing pending pick up was there something changed on Unis end that may have triggered this? 5N9KX8XE – no ASN received à Cancelled – no 945s will be sent for cancelled orders> This PO is linked with 5KC2GOFG which was delivered we will ensure to dispute here @Brittany Wagner please note to remove any PO from the ARN if we know we will be canceling to avoid missing ASN charges going forward. 15MD239J - B0DWGM5ZXQ not on ASN à Sent and acknowledged> B0DWGM5ZXQ ASIN missing from the 940 Orgain team working on this. Thank you! Leticia Oropeza Administrator, EDITel: (949) 930-0039 ext.275 Fax: (949) 625-7180 Email: Leticia.Oropeza@drinkorgain.com Website: www.Orgain.com From: Alfred Garcia <alfred.garcia@item.com> Sent: Thursday, September 11, 2025 3:36 PM To: Leticia Oropeza <Leticia.Oropeza@drinkorgain.com>; Susan Mendez <susan.mendez@unisco.com>; Andrei Simon <router39@unisco.com> Cc: Daniel Blanco <Daniel.Blanco@drinkorgain.com>; Brendon Greeley <Brendon.Greeley@drinkorgain.com>; EDI Support <EDI.support@drinkorgain.com>; Dynnah Delamora <Dynnah.Delamora@drinkorgain.com>; jonathan.white <jonathan.white@unisco.com>; edi <edi@item.com> Subject: RE: Amazon- Missing ASN Chargebacks Hi @Leticia Oropeza, Below is the status of our ongoing investigations for the 945/ASN issues raised: 3IZ3EMTZ – one shipment did not get an ASN à Checking 36XKU9HX – B00BKL4KKY not on ASN à Checking 3TR9D5OB – no ASN received à Sent and acknowledged > Confirming 945 was recieved and this was an SPS error 6A1HBXMK - B00JTX7SHC & B01CI57UD4 not on ASN à Still in partial shipped status in WISE Mult Truck shipment- one ASN missing>Status was in transit this morning and now showing pending pick up was there something changed on Unis end that may have triggered this? 5N9KX8XE – no ASN received à Cancelled – no 945s will be sent for cancelled orders> This PO is linked with 5KC2GOFG which was delivered we will ensure to dispute here and advise the CS Team to remove a PO from the ARN is we know we will be cancelling. 15MD239J - B0DWGM5ZXQ not on ASN à Sent and acknowledged>B0DWGM5ZXQ missing from the 945 does this have to be cross referenced to UPC on Unis end? Regards, Alfred Garcia EDI Analyst Buena Park, CA | PST alfred.garcia@item.com | www.item.com From: Leticia Oropeza <Leticia.Oropeza@drinkorgain.com> Sent: Thursday, September 11, 2025 11:23 AM To: Alfred Garcia <alfred.garcia@item.com>; Susan Mendez <susan.mendez@unisco.com>; Andrei Simon <router39@unisco.com> Cc: Daniel Blanco <Daniel.Blanco@drinkorgain.com>; Brendon Greeley <Brendon.Greeley@drinkorgain.com>; EDI Support <EDI.support@drinkorgain.com>; Dynnah Delamora <Dynnah.Delamora@drinkorgain.com>; jonathan.white <jonathan.white@unisco.com> Subject: Amazon- Missing ASN Chargebacks Importance: High Hi Unis Team, We have received a spike in the number of ASN chargebacks for the Month of August and after review they are all driven by Unis shipments. I have reviewed on our end and have found the details below can you please confirm the reason these ASN''s were not sent to Amazon? I want to reiterate the importance of sending these ASN''s as soon as order ships to prevent these chargebacks, please confirm what measures will be taken for this issue going forward. 3IZ3EMTZ – one shipment did not get an ASN 3TR9D5OB – no ASN received 6A1HBXMK - B00JTX7SHC & B01CI57UD4 not on ASN Mult Truck shipment- one ASN missing 36XKU9HX – B00BKL4KKY not on ASN 5N9KX8XE – no ASN received 15MD239J - B0DWGM5ZXQ not on ASN Thank you! Leticia Oropeza Administrator, EDITel: (949) 930-0039 ext.275 Fax: (949) 625-7180 Email: Leticia.Oropeza@drinkorgain.com Website: www.Orgain.com CAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.','["Internal Business Communication", "Project Updates"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T14:06:58.095657+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "embedding_chunk_size": 8191, "handle": null, "azure_endpoint": null, "azure_version": null, "azure_deployment": null}','[-0.014098624,-0.022952832,0.00024221367,-0.028987315,-0.016972836,0.022108275,-0.019506501,0.0008726503,-0.0041955323,-0.019615477,0.011599013,-0.018934384,0.015869465,-0.010563752,0.010427533,-0.011455983,0.021508915,0.0062422166,0.005605395,0.019165955,-0.058301553,0.005438527,-0.0037323893,0.0353351,-0.007805325,-0.020541763,0.009228809,-0.016346231,-0.00039758798,-0.025718069,-0.0019700613,-0.008704368,-0.007314938,-0.0012148995,-0.019288551,0.004982195,0.02007862,0.009623843,0.017258896,-0.0029235913,0.022326225,0.009215187,0.010168717,-0.008241224,-0.0014405116,0.0241788,-0.00302235,-0.