INSERT INTO public.resource_memory (id, title, summary, resource_type, content, tree_path, last_modify, metadata_, embedding_config, summary_embedding, created_at, updated_at, is_deleted, _created_by_id, _last_updated_by_id, organization_id, user_id) VALUES ('res_VGWS','Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review','Email chain discussing issues with invoices on hold due to missing GL coding. Involves discussions between Jeff Alford, Ubed Patel, and others regarding document access and EDI setup. Updated with latest email correspondence detailing document status triggering and viewing access issues.','email','Hi Amanda, If I understand what you are saying, 1 of the PDF’s needs to be labeled “invoice” to trigger “done”? We attempted to view the backup docs in the portal but were not able to open any of them, do we not have access to view? Ubed, Which document do you need to review to determine GL coding, Invoice or BOL? Jeff Alford Director, LTL Sales 480.653-2444 6801 North Cotton Lane, Waddell, AZ 85355 Jeff.alford@unisco.com | www.unisco.com From: Amanda Simons Sent: Monday, September 15, 2025 1:39 AM To: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Hello only when we receive the invoice PDF or a PDF without a label the document status is turned to DONE Here we received 3 docs and none of those labelled as ‘ invoice’ that is why its doesn’t show DONE Thank You Amanda Simons Customer Success Maastricht, The Netherlands Please send all emails to customersuccess@intelligentaudit.com From: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com> Sent: Monday, September 15, 2025 10:26 AM To: Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Hi Dayanara, I am also able to see document only for PRO# 214838 Any other examples you can see? @EDI Support We can see the Document in the portal but the document Done is still blank, can you help fix it. Thank You Ubed Patel. From: Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com> Sent: Saturday, September 13, 2025 3:02 AM To: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review CAUTION!: This email originated from outside of Eaton. Please exercise caution when clicking links or opening attachments. Hello Ubed, Upon reviewing the first sample in the file you sent — PRO# 214838 in the IA portal — I can see that we’ve already provided the backup documents. Could you please confirm if there are any additional documents needed to process these? Please see the screenshot below for reference. From: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com> Sent: Friday, September 12, 2025 12:16 AM To: Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Hi Dayanara, Attached list of invoices are missing backup documents. Please have it uploaded, others I will have team expedite the Gl coding. Thank You Ubed Patel. From: Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com> Sent: Friday, September 12, 2025 10:19 AM To: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review CAUTION!: This email originated from outside of Eaton. Please exercise caution when clicking links or opening attachments. Hello Ubed and Team, Sharing the updated Missing GL status attached. Since several invoices are past due, it would be really helpful if we could give these priority so we can stay on track. Please let me know if there’s anything I can do on my side to support. From: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com> Sent: Friday, September 5, 2025 11:36 AM To: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Hi Jeff, Any update if your EDI team can add the EFLN in the requested field? Thank You Ubed Patel. From: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com> Sent: Tuesday, August 19, 2025 11:54 AM To: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review CAUTION!: This email originated from outside of Eaton. Please exercise caution when clicking links or opening attachments. Hi Ubed, I’m not sure why invoices in file are missing backup docs, they show sent on our side, I have Olumide in TMS Support looking into it. Dayanara will be happy to resend that backup docs. Also, Had a discussion with Olumide, I believe we have a fix where we can map the EFLN code to the N1*BT field as requested, should know by next week if it works. Jeff Alford Director, LTL Sales 480.653-2444 6801 North Cotton Lane, Waddell, AZ 85355 Jeff.alford@unisco.com | www.unisco.com From: Patel, Ubedullah Sent: Monday, August 18, 2025 11:04 PM To: Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Some people who received this message don''t often get email from ubedullahpatel@eaton.com. Learn why this is important Hi Dayanara, Attached list of invoices are missing backup documents please have it submitted to GL code them, Confirm once submitted. Thank You Ubed Patel. From: Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com> Sent: Tuesday, August 19, 2025 2:33 AM To: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review CAUTION!: This email originated from outside of Eaton. Please exercise caution when clicking links or opening attachments. Hello Ubed & Jeff, Based on our meeting today, please find attached the list of invoices with a Missing GL status. Could you kindly help reach out to Eaton to have these fixed? Thank you for your support. From: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com> Sent: Wednesday, August 13, 2025 11:11 AM To: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Hi Ubed, Adding the EFLN code to the field you are requesting is most likely not possible, the code you are seeing in the examples you sent is out internal account code for the Eaton/IA bill too. We would not be able to create a separate bill to for each ship from location for corresponding EFLN. We included the EFLN on the shipper location because when we first started with Eaton, each business unit had different pricing and in order for the correct pricing to pull in our rate engine, we had to tie it to the ship from location by EFLN. I have standardized the pricing in recent RFP’s so that it is the same across business units out of Fontana for example as they have multiple EFLN’s. How is this issue being handle by other carriers? Maybe we need to look at their EDI 210 and see if we can map ours to match. Jeff Alford Director, LTL Sales 480.653-2444 6801 North Cotton Lane, Waddell, AZ 85355 Jeff.alford@unisco.com | www.unisco.com From: Patel, Ubedullah Sent: Wednesday, August 13, 2025 7:08 AM To: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Hi Jeff, I am attaching few example highlighting where we can see EFLN’s highlighted in BOL’s Also in the below example you shared if you are able to add only the EFLN to the mentioned place then IA can auto code those. And as per my team’s experience we do receive approximately 30% of the BOL’s with EFLN mentioned on it. Let me know you are able to make these changes? N1*BT*EATON CORP C/O INTELLIGENT AUDIT*25*CH1007 Thank you Ubed Patel. From: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com> Sent: Tuesday, August 12, 2025 9:42 PM To: Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; Amanda Simons amanda@intelligentaudit.com; Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review CAUTION!: This email originated from outside of Eaton. Please exercise caution when clicking links or opening attachments. Hi Caitlin, I did some spot checking on BOL’s from Dallas and Fontana but it looks like we do include the EFLN in the EDI210 on the N1*SH* line (shipper location) but I will need to look at more shipments to confirm consistency, we have the EFLN coded into the shipper locatation. This is the EDI210 on pro 61419956: From Reno- pro 3040275 Jeff Alford Director, LTL Sales 480.653-2444 6801 North Cotton Lane, Waddell, AZ 85355 Jeff.alford@unisco.com | www.unisco.com From: Tournay, Caitlin G Sent: Tuesday, August 12, 2025 8:16 AM To: Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Some people who received this message don''t often get email from caitlingtournay@eaton.com. Learn why this is important Hi Amanda- this is correct. Eaton is not set up to send this information over EDI to carriers for outbound at this time. Thanks, Caitlin From: Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com> Sent: Tuesday, August 12, 2025 6:54 AM To: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review CAUTION!: This email originated from outside of Eaton. Please exercise caution when clicking links or opening attachments. Hello Reading this,i dont think this needs IA EDI support. Is this not the feed from Eaton to Unis? The 204? Currently BOLs are entered manually - if 204 feed then the info can be transmitted from Eaton to Unis Thank You Amanda Simons Customer Success Maastricht, The Netherlands Please send all emails to customersuccess@intelligentaudit.com From: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com> Sent: Tuesday, August 12, 2025 11:22 AM To: Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com>; EDI Support <edisupport@intelligentaudit.com> Cc: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Ryan Kerr <ryan.kerr@intelligentaudit.com>; Amanda Simons <amanda@intelligentaudit.com>; House, Justin A <JustinAHouse@eaton.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Hi @edisupport@intelligentaudit.com Can you please review below comments from Yuki and advise if we can set up 204 with Unis? Thank you Ubed Patel. From: Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com> Sent: Saturday, August 9, 2025 12:10 AM To: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com> Cc: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Importance: High CAUTION!: This email originated from outside of Eaton. Please exercise caution when clicking links or opening attachments. Hi Ubed, It’s difficult to have EFLN accurately sent in EDI 210 if we don’t have EDI 204 initially set up to capture all the necessary information from the shipper. Could you please review the case and see if it’s possible to set up EDI 204 first with all EFLN included? Currently, we only have EDI 204 with Uber Freight for cross-dock business. The other Eaton plants do not have either ASN or EDI 204 set up. All BOLs are being entered manually, and this creates gaps if EFLN needs to be sent in EDI 210, since 210 transmits invoice amounts only. In the meantime, we are also looking at possible alternative actions to address the gap until EDI 204 can be implemented. From: Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com> Sent: Friday, August 8, 2025 11:05 AM To: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; tmssupport <tmssupport@unisco.com> Cc: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com>; Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Importance: High ++ UNIS EDI and @tmssupport, please see below request for EDI feed update. and confirm ASAP From: Patel, Ubedullah <UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com> Sent: Friday, August 8, 2025 2:51 AM To: Dayanara Blanco <dayanara.blanco@unisco.com>; Tournay, Caitlin G <CaitlinGTournay@Eaton.com>; April Williams <awilliams@intelligentaudit.com>; Omi Pimpre <omi.pimpre@intelligentaudit.com>; List-Logistics-FBA <List-Logistics-FBA@Eaton.com> Cc: Jeff Alford <jeff.alford@unisco.com>; Yuki Ho <yuki.ho@unisco.com>; Kim Simon Kalaw <kim.kalaw@unisco.com>; Norman Jay Bersabal <norman.bersabal@unisco.com> Subject: RE: [EXTERNAL] Invoices On Hold – Missing GL for Review Hi Dayanara, Can I request for a minor update in the EDI feed from your EDI team to update the EFLN present in the BOL,to update in the EDI N1 BT/4 field so that such invoices do not go on hold and will be processed automatically. Below BOL is for Pro # 61419956 and can that be added to the EDI field shown in the 2nd screenshot. Let me know if this request can be catered too and also let me know If a meeting is required to discuss this topic.','["Delivery Failures", "Out-of-Office and Irrelevant System Auto-Replies"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T15:47:11.703127+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https: