INSERT INTO public.resource_memory (id, title, summary, resource_type, content, tree_path, last_modify, metadata_, embedding_config, summary_embedding, created_at, updated_at, is_deleted, _created_by_id, _last_updated_by_id, organization_id, user_id) VALUES ('res_WTSZ','EDI846 Inventory Snapshot Missing - Communication','Emails discussing issues related to EDI846 Inventory Snapshot missing from UNIS since August 7, involving stakeholders like Eaden Wu and Paul Chen. It includes resolution steps and confirmations.','email','Hi @Yunjie (Bob) Wang 王运届 and @Paul Chen陈荣民,After confirmation, the inventory report has not been configured for USUNI_RS/USUNI_EP; It has been re-added and the inventory has been re-pushed. Please pay attention to the AS2 transmission of EDI_846 information. Best Regards，Zhiqiang Wu(Eaden)Peking, CNSenior EDI engineerM +86 15083820695zhiqiang.wu@item.com发件人: Yunjie (Bob) Wang 王运届 <bob.wang1@tcl.com>发送时间: 2025年9月16日 0:02收件人: Paul Chen陈荣民 <chenrm@tcl.com>; Eaden Wu <eaden.wu@item.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; Implementation@item.com <Implementation@item.com>; Elijah Jia <elijah.jia@item.com>; Shelia Sun <shelia.sun@item.com>; tcl.bp@unisco.com <tcl.bp@unisco.com>; EDI UNISCO <edi@unisco.com>抄送: Hyper ZHU <hyper.zhu@tcl.com>; NABG IT Support Desk <NABG.ITSupport@tcl.com>; Ruoyi Jin <ruoyi.jin@tcl.com>; Zac Zalewski <zac.zalewski@tcl.com>; TCL EDI Service <tcledi@tcl.com>主题: Re: [URGENT] EDI846 Inventory Snapshot Missing from UNIS since 7-Aug  Hi @Paul Chen陈荣民 @Eaden WuI can see EDI846 for three warehousesUSUNI_BP (Buena Park, CA)USUNI_GA (Pooler, GA)USUNI_PA (Northampton, PA)But not for the new warehouses. USUNI_RS (Riverside, CA)USUNI_EP (El Paso, TX)Please review and fix. Thanks, BobFrom: Paul Chen陈荣民 <chenrm@tcl.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 9, 2025 11:00 PMTo: Eaden Wu <eaden.wu@item.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; Implementation@item.com <Implementation@item.com>; Elijah Jia <elijah.jia@item.com>; Shelia Sun <shelia.sun@item.com>; tcl.bp@unisco.com <tcl.bp@unisco.com>; EDI UNISCO <edi@unisco.com>; Yunjie (Bob) Wang 王运届 <bob.wang1@tcl.com>Cc: Hyper ZHU <hyper.zhu@tcl.com>; NABG IT Support Desk <NABG.ITSupport@tcl.com>; Ruoyi Jin <ruoyi.jin@tcl.com>; Zac Zalewski <zac.zalewski@tcl.com>; TCL EDI Service <tcledi@tcl.com>Subject: RE: [URGENT] EDI846 Inventory Snapshot Missing from UNIS since 7-Aug  Thanks Eaden.The 846 files are received .   @Yunjie (Bob) Wang 王运届 please note.发件人: Eaden Wu <eaden.wu@item.com>发送时间: 2025年9月10日 10:38收件人: Paul Chen陈荣民 <chenrm@tcl.com>; wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; Implementation@item.com <Implementation@item.com>; Elijah Jia <elijah.jia@item.com>; Shelia Sun <shelia.sun@item.com>; tcl.bp@unisco.com <tcl.bp@unisco.com>; EDI UNISCO <edi@unisco.com>抄送: Hyper ZHU <hyper.zhu@tcl.com>; Yunjie (Bob) Wang 王运届 <bob.wang1@tcl.com>; NABG IT Support Desk <NABG.ITSupport@tcl.com>; Ruoyi Jin <ruoyi.jin@tcl.com>; Zac Zalewski <zac.zalewski@tcl.com>主题: [External Sender]回复: [URGENT] EDI846 Inventory Snapshot Missing from UNIS since 7-Aug  Hi @Paul Chen陈荣民,Thanks for the reminder.The inventory report was interrupted due to an abnormal inventory record in August. After checking, the internal team has completed the fix.The latest inventory data has now been sent back via AS2. Please help confirm. Thank you for your cooperation.Best Regards，Zhiqiang Wu(Eaden)Peking, CNSenior EDI engineerM +86 15083820695zhiqiang.wu@item.com发件人: Paul Chen陈荣民 <chenrm@tcl.com>发送时间: 2025年9月10日 9:47收件人: wise support <wisesupport@unisco.com>; Implementation@item.com <Implementation@item.com>; Eaden Wu <eaden.wu@item.com>; Elijah Jia <elijah.jia@item.com>; Shelia Sun <shelia.sun@item.com>; tcl.bp@unisco.com <tcl.bp@unisco.com>; EDI UNISCO <edi@unisco.com>抄送: Hyper ZHU <hyper.zhu@tcl.com>; Yunjie (Bob) Wang 王运届 <bob.wang1@tcl.com>; NABG IT Support Desk <NABG.ITSupport@tcl.com>; Ruoyi Jin <ruoyi.jin@tcl.com>; Zac Zalewski <zac.zalewski@tcl.com>主题: [URGENT] EDI846 Inventory Snapshot Missing from UNIS since 7-Aug  Some people who received this message don''t often get email from chenrm@tcl.com. Learn why this is important Dear UNIS team,we have noticed that since August 7, the UNIS system has stopped pushing 846 data. Please help check the issue and restore the data push as soon as possible. Thank you!the last  EDI file for your ref.     :      846-TCLNORTH-UNIS-20250807-000005184.ediRegards,Paul发件人: Paul Chen陈荣民 <chenrm@tcl.com>发送时间: 2025年9月10日 9:28收件人: Yunjie (Bob) Wang 王运届 <bob.wang1@tcl.com>; Sewell Zhi 植秀佳 <xiujia.zhi@tcl.com>抄送: Ruoyi Jin <ruoyi.jin@tcl.com>; Zac Zalewski <zac.zalewski@tcl.com>; NABG IT Support Desk <NABG.ITSupport@tcl.com>主题: 回复: EDI846 Inventory Snapshot Missing from UNIS Dear bob,I find that UNIS doesn''t push 846 data since 8-Aug. I will have a chek with UNIS IT team.发件人: Yunjie (Bob) Wang 王运届 <bob.wang1@tcl.com>发送时间: 2025年9月9日 23:11收件人: Paul Chen陈荣民 <chenrm@tcl.com>; Sewell Zhi 植秀佳 <xiujia.zhi@tcl.com>抄送: Ruoyi Jin <ruoyi.jin@tcl.com>; Zac Zalewski <zac.zalewski@tcl.com>; NABG IT Support Desk <NABG.ITSupport@tcl.com>主题: Re: EDI846 Inventory Snapshot Missing from UNIS @Paul Chen陈荣民EDI运维问题周统计.xlsxIssue DateAreaThemePriorityTopic Description TaskCurrent Status/NotesStatusPICTarget Finish Date9/9/2025ITEDI Issue (846)2-HighUNIS EDI846 Inventory Snapshot MissingDiagnose the Root Cause; Add back missing snapshots. OngoingPaul9/12/2025Thanks,BobFrom: Yunjie (Bob) Wang 王运届 <bob.wang1@tcl.com>Sent: Tuesday, September 9, 2025 10:41 AMTo: Paul Chen陈荣民 <chenrm@tcl.com>; Sewell Zhi 植秀佳 <xiujia.zhi@tcl.com>Cc: Ruoyi Jin <ruoyi.jin@tcl.com>; Zac Zalewski <zac.zalewski@tcl.com>; NABG IT Support Desk <NABG.ITSupport@tcl.com>Subject: EDI846 Inventory Snapshot Missing from UNIS @Paul Chen陈荣民, @Sewell Zhi 植秀佳,BI Team noticed UNIS inventory snapshots are missed from Inventory Master Report (Daily) since 8/7. Please review and fix. If UNIS issue, work together with UNIS IT to rectify.Yunjie (Bob) Wang Business Process ManagerTCL North AmericaMobil