INSERT INTO public.resource_memory (id, title, summary, resource_type, content, tree_path, last_modify, metadata_, embedding_config, summary_embedding, created_at, updated_at, is_deleted, _created_by_id, _last_updated_by_id, organization_id, user_id) VALUES ('res_EK63','Weekly Project Status Update (2025-09-08 to 2025-09-12)','Email received from Eaden Wu containing weekly project status updates for multiple customers, categorized under Promotional, Marketing, and Product Updates. It includes ongoing tasks, incidents, integration progress, and challenges for various customers such as TCL North America, EMS Mind Reader LLC, SharkNinja Sales Company, and others.','email','Dear All, 周报内容如下，祝周末愉快! DATE 9/13/2025 WEEKLY REPORT To:Shelia Sun From:Eaden WU Subject:Weekly Project Status Update Period Ending:9/08 – 9/12 ACTIVITIES IN THIS WEEK ACTIVITIES IN PROCESS NEXT ACTION Name: Eaden’ Customers:TCL NORTH AMERICA, EMS MIND READER LLC ,MIKE''S HOT HONEY, SharkNinja Sales Company, EMS MIND READER LLC,VITA COCO - DTC, FILIPPO BERIO USA LTD, GALANZ AMERICAS LIMITED COMPANY, LENOVO GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY, TRI-UNION SEAFOODS, LLC, Flowserve , Angelcare, 5 Star Apparel LLC Tasks and Incidents for Customers After Go-Live TCL NORTH AMERICA —Ongoing-Assisting the customer in investigating the cause of the inventory discrepancy, it was confirmed that the issue was due to dirty data in the inventory report generated by MWS. As a result, inventory data has not been properly transmitted to the customer since August. The abnormal data has now been flagged for correction, and the latest inventory data has been retransmitted via AS2. -Assisting the customer in correcting the EDI_945 data, there were two exception cases this week:In one order, the TotalOrderedQty and TotalShippedQty fields were empty when generating the DC.In another order, multiple SKUs were mixed on the same pallet. EMS MIND READER LLC —Done- Cooperating with the customer to adjust the EDI_940 mapping logic: when Retailer = ODC2, the Sales Order# needs to be mapped to DynTxtPropertyValue23 so that the label can correctly retrieve this information. -Supporting internal testing of the WMS 3.0 process: a total of 23 retailers, and the orders have already been imported into the Preview environment, awaiting QA team verification to confirm whether they meet expectations. SharkNinja Sales Company —Ongoing-Assisted the customer in adjusting the logic for generating reports for the retailer “Sam Club.” A ticket has been submitted to the WMS team, and we are awaiting further testing. VITA COCO - DTC —Ongoing-The customer has reviewed the inventory data transmitted last week and found that the expired status data and damaged status data did not meet expectations. The internal team has promptly completed a version update and is preparing to transmit the latest data to the customer for confirmation. GALANZ AMERICAS LIMITED COMPANY —Done- The customer reported not receiving the DC data. After checking, the sending process was confirmed to be normal, and the data has been retransmitted. FILIPPO BERIO USA LTD—Done- Assisted the customer in investigating the cause of the ASN penalty. After a detailed investigation, we found an issue with the mapping logic of the N1*ST segment in the EDI_856 — it needs to map the N1*ST data from the EDI_940. We have adjusted the logic as requested and retransmitted the ASN; we are currently awaiting the customer''s confirmation on whether it meets expectations. LENOVO GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY —Done- Assisted the internal team in investigating the Lenovo exception alert. After confirmation, the issue was caused by the webMethods SaaS platform timing out while fetching FTP data, due to insufficient data polling and thread resources. The SaaS team needs to be contacted for follow-up and resolution. TRI-UNION SEAFOODS, LLC —Done- Assisted the customer in investigating the DN data import issue in the WISE system. After confirmation, the problem was due to incorrect ShipMethod/freight terms information being transmitted. The customer has been reminded to retransmit the data using the standard enumerated values. New Customer Overview#1 Customer Name (Mandatory): CubeShip-VIZIO 1) Integration Progress Detailed status of ongoing integration efforts (Mandatory) Continuing to support the customer in testing ASN messages, we are waiting for the CubeShip team to adjust the DTM segment date information as requested by the customer and regenerate the ASN for transmission. 2) Labels/BOL/Packing List(printing Docs) Docs Counts (Mandatory)：0 Associated Jira Tickets & Stuck Points (Optional) Status Descriptions (Mandatory) Null Current Challenges and Blockers (Optional) 3) Wise System Configuration Detailed description of Wise setup activities (Mandatory) The customer already exists, no configuration is needed. 4) Customized Requirements Jira Tickets & Blockers (Optional) Specific customizations and implementation notes (Optional) 5) Item Master Preview Imports (Mandatory) The customer already exists, no configuration is needed. Production Imports (Mandatory) The customer already exists, no configuration is needed. Special Requirements (Mandatory) Null 6) Shipping Accounts Small Parcel Account Setup (Mandatory) Null Shipping Routing Table (Optional) Billing Party Setup (Optional) 7) Retailers Configuration of retailer profiles within Wise (Mandatory) The customer already exists, no configuration is needed. 8) Other Summary of overall issues, blockers, and unresolved problems (Optional) #2 Customer Name (Mandatory): Angelcare 1) Integration Progress Detailed status of ongoing integration efforts (Mandatory) Continuing to assist the customer with EDI_940/945 testing. The second batch of test orders has all been returned via EDI_945, and we are awaiting the customer''s confirmation on whether they meet expectations. 2) Labels/BOL/Packing List(printing Docs) Docs Counts (Mandatory)：0 Associated Jira Tickets & Stuck Points (Optional) Status Descriptions (Manda