.1063Joseph.sparacino@unisco.com www.unisco.com From: Stacy Nguyen <stacy.nguyen@item.com> Sent: Wednesday, September 10, 2025 5:38 PMTo: Joseph Sparacino <joseph.sparacino@unisco.com>Cc: Jimoh Yusuf <jimoh.yusuf@unisco.com>; Shelia Sun <shelia.sun@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@item.com>Subject: Implementation Specialist - E-commerce And Supply Chain Systems Hi Joseph Could you please reach out to the attached candidate?“Comprehensive knowledge of EDI technologies and transactions to support e-commerce platform and performance. Strategic involvement in supply chain, logistics and ocean cargo management. “ Stacy NguyenIT General ManagerM 626.803.6525stacy.nguyen@item.com|www.item.com','["Platform", "Document", "Resource Sharing"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T17:07:27.667640+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "embedding_chunk_size": 8191, "handle": null, "azure_endpoint": null, "azure_version": null, "azure_deployment": null}','[-0.012280987,-0.030876352,0.018997684,-0.0055233757,-0.0067030597,0.018984046,-0.011667279,0.0015146664,-0.02820331,-0.0131947305,0.0073849577,-0.009546575,0.010228473,-0.013453851,0.00031218154,-0.017974837,0.025339337,-0.010971743,-0.01226053,-0.025502993,-0.0381863,-0.0024156244,0.0101739215,0.022393538,-0.0031657123,-0.012240073,0.011783201,-0.016938351,-0.0075622513,-0.0074326904,0.0040538847,-0.014551708,0.0063280156,-0.017020179,-0.020416033,-0.025421165,0.027766895,-0.025039302,0.0066416888,0.0037299832,0.018615821,0.017442957,0.0053938148,-0.031040007,0.0028690868,0.023007246,-0.020361481,-0.018029388,0.012976523,0.015383624,0.015697297,0.007241759,-0.02358004,0.022489004,0.0029850095,-0.0068360297,-0.0006460986,0.020675154,-0.012819686,-0.008182779,-0.007671355,-0.011094484,-0.010439862,-0.0017226454,-0.010808087,-0.006781478,-0.028776105,0.0031503697,-0.00022928827,-0