 Sent: Wednesday, September 10, 2025 5:38 PMTo: Joseph Sparacino <joseph.sparacino@unisco.com>Cc: Jimoh Yusuf <jimoh.yusuf@unisco.com>; Shelia Sun <shelia.sun@item.com>; Jennifer Kuo <jennifer.kuo@item.com>Subject: Implementation Specialist - E-commerce And Supply Chain Systems Hi Joseph Could you please reach out to the attached candidate? “Comprehensive knowledge of EDI technologies and transactions to support e-commerce platform and performance. Strategic involvement in supply chain, logistics and ocean cargo management. “ Stacy NguyenIT General ManagerM 626.803.6525stacy.nguyen@item.com|www.item.com ','["Platform", "Document", "Resource Sharing"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T17:03:39.511967+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "embedding_chunk_size": 8191, "handle": null, "azure_endpoint": null, "azure_version": null, "azure_deployment": null}','[-0.019400675,-0.016308397,0.010950692,-0.009243218,0.0015091654,0.028798506,-0.0328588,-0.01189182,-0.005078728,-0.010211235,0.01743775,-0.020341802,0.020503137,-0.009209606,0.0050249496,-0.0013570724,0.026983473,-0.014278251,-0.012012822,-0.033073913,-0.045980807,-0.004661943,0.010244846,-0.010392738,-0.01407658,-0.01913178,0.0141303595,-0.024025643,-0.0074416306,-0.010547352,-0.0029679132,-0.010345682,-0.0036872036,-0.008120587,-0.025087774,-0.019145224,0.015044598,-0.012113657,0.024348317,0.00095121114,0.025437336,0.00850376,0.007273572,-0.020355247,0.013565683,0.016550401,-0.013350568,-0.02901362,-0.00968017,0.019239338,0.0056602103,0.0202208,-0.011024638,0.020758586,-0.0066315886,0.000387795,-0.00789875,0.024496207,-0.009263385,-0.0013822812,-0.012880004,-0.007347518,-0.01852677,-0.009229773,-0.011118751,-0.022829067,-0.026459131,0.021874495,0.006066912,-0.0043224646,0.04081805,0.021982053,-0.019212449,0.01893011,0.03272435,0.015286602,0.0030569842,0.014466477