nd them, or if we should wait a few more days for the remaining documents to reflect in your system. Amanda Simons 2025-08-25 05:13 GMT-4 Hello I got two docs attached Pro 61429449 and pro 61438289 Those attached on 8/20 Can you provide some details on how the below docs were sent? 61470326 61470271 61470825 File name Who send it To which email address Thank You Amanda Simons Customer Success Maastricht, The Netherlands <http://www.intelligentaudit.com/> Please send all emails to customersuccess@intelligentaudit.com | UbedullahPatel@Eaton.com 2025-08-24 12:07 GMT-4 Hi Dayanara, We did not received any backup documents till today, we will wait for few more days usually it takes a week to get attached. Thank You Ubed Patel. dayanara.blanco@unisco.com 2025-08-19 16:59 GMT-4 Hello Ubed, We’ve sent the backup documents for the 96 invoices — could you kindly confirm if you’ve received them? This message is automatically generated by Notification Assistant for Jira using the Ticket Comment - Production Support Tickets Notification. If you think it was sent incorrectly, please contact your Jira administrators For more information about Notification Assistant for Jira, see: https://atlasauthority.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/NAFJC/overview','["Delivery Failures", "Out-of-Office and Irrelevant System Auto-Replies"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T17:27:38.082880+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "embedding_chunk_size": 8191, "handle": null, "azure_endpoint": null, "azure_version": null, "azure_deployment": null}','[-0.019895647,0.00055629277,0.0034951812,-0.035093315,-0.00056646345,0.0141080795,-0.017999476,0.004765191,0.006144868,-0.011412404,0.029489707,0.009169544,0.0067745666,0.023574784,-0.011150618,0.006367739,0.011369952,-2.6877717e-05,0.011829844,-0.0036968263,-0.023093667,0.009884146,-0.017405152,0.012218984,0.0011