sion of Walmart carton labels. If not ready, please provide an ETA for each. Regards Wajih JelassiIT Project Manager | Gestionnaire de projet TIAngelcare group | Le groupe AngelcareP +1-579-790-1150C +1-514-577-8589Le Holding Angelcare inc. 2000, avenue McGill College, bureau 250 Montréal, Québec, H3A 3H3, Canada NOTE: This email, its contents and attached files are privileged, confidential and subject to copyright. It is forbidden to use or disclose without authorization. NOTE : Ce courriel, son contenu et ses dossiers joints sont privilégiés, confidentiels et soumis à des droits d''auteur. Il est interdit de les utiliser ou de les divulguer sans autorisation. HINWEIS: Diese E-Mail, ihr Inhalt und die angehängten Dateien sind privilegiert, vertraulich und unterliegen dem Urheberrecht. Es ist verboten, sie ohne Genehmigung zu verwenden oder weiterzugeben From: Wajih Jelassi <WJelassi@angelcaregroup.com> Sent: August 29, 2025 8:29 AMTo: Shelia Sun <shelia.sun@item.com>; Christine Schwab Dumas <CDumas@angelcaregroup.com>Cc: Sai Sathvik Karla <sai.karla@item.com>; Eaden Wu <eaden.wu@item.com>; Leonardo Alves <leonardo.alves@item.com>; Brandon Davis <dmbrandon@spscommerce.com>; Regis de Ramiro <rderamiro@angelcaregroup.com>; Robert Leadbeater <robert.leadbeater@gls-canada.com>; Jody Crouse <jody.crouse@item.com>; Stephane Huot <shuot@angelcaregroup.com>; edi <edi@item.com>Subject: RE: Non EDI customers - Labels Hi Shelia, This is a pallet label that we use with all our customer, it’s not related to a specific carrier (such as Fedex, UPS…etc.) I know that the SID is the shipping ID and the BOL no as well. For the Destination Loc, it’s probably a location ID assigned by the current 3PL for each ship-to but I need to double check before affirming that. What I can do, I can provide you with a table with the field, signification, and data source. Let know if this works for you.Wajih JelassiIT Project Manager | Gestionnaire de projet TIAngelcare group | Le groupe AngelcareP +