ded recipient, any disclosure, distribution, copying or other use of this communication is strictly prohibited. If you are not the intended recipient, please advise the sender by reply e-mail and immediately delete the message and any attachments without copying or disclosing the contents. Thank you. From: Christina Kennedy <christina.kennedy@unisco.com> Sent: Wednesday, September 10, 2025 09:47 AMTo: Miroslav Golodinski <miroslav.golodinski@turtlebeach.com>; Sai Sathvik Karla <sai.karla@item.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Alfred Garcia <alfred.garcia@item.com>; Dan Linnihan <dan.linnihan@unisco.com>Cc: Carlos Maldonado <carlos.maldonado@turtlebeach.com>; Craig DeGreef <Craig.DeGreef@unisco.com>; Jeff Wiliams <jeff.williams@unisco.com>Subject: RE: Missing SHIP NOTIFICATIONs [WARNING: EXTERNAL SENDER] Hello, Yes we were made aware of the reports this morning. I am waiting on word back from IT. Until they can be fix and resent, please see attached shipping and receiving report from yesterday. Thank You Christina KennedyAccount ManagerDirect 626.626.8981 | Office 626.271.98063901 S. Brandon Rd, Elwood, IL 60421 From: Miroslav Golodinski <miroslav.golodinski@turtlebeach.com> Sent: Wednesday, September 10, 2025 8:42 AMTo: Sai Sathvik Karla <sai.karla@item.com>; Christina Kennedy <christina.kennedy@unisco.com>; EDI ITEM <edi@item.com>; EDI <edi@unisco.com>; Alfred Garcia <alfred.garcia@item.com>; Dan Linnihan <dan.linnihan@unisco.com>Cc: Carlos Maldonado <carlos.maldonado@turtlebeach.com>; Craig DeGreef <craig.degreef@unisco.com>; Jeff Wiliams <jeff.williams@unisco.com>Subject: RE: Missing SHIP NOTIFICATIONsImportance: High Good Morning, We have not received any emailed reports from last night or this morning.Can you please urgently check on this and email reports? Thank you, Miroslav GolodinskiSr. Manager Regional Operations – US TURTLE BEACH CORPORATION NASDAQ: TBCH 44 South Broadway, 4th Floor | White Plains, NY 10601TEL : 914-906-5468E-Mail miros