fer.kuo@unisco.com>; Cara Gao <cara.gao@item.com> Subject: RE: Rate Shop Hi @Michelle Topete, I have also sent DN-204486 - 082425325703A as rate shop but have specified no signature by leaving the field blank. Can you please review this and let me know if it arrived with NSR? This can ship as rate shop if all is good on your side.','["Industry Reports", "Thought Leadership and Executive Insights"]','{"timestamp": "2025-10-19T19:01:25.168986+00:00", "operation": "created"}','{}','{"embedding_endpoint_type": "openai", "embedding_endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "embedding_chunk_size": 8191, "handle": null, "azure_endpoint": null, "azure_version": null, "azure_deployment": null}','[-0.01329105,-0.01212493,-0.0039961804,-0.02905073,-0.01823513,0.010992905,-0.007085378,-0.011818055,-0.021453897,-0.04669939,-0.006198853,-0.028041456,0.0025112515,0.0012769365,0.010195034,0.0066182474,0.010992905,-0.0009726198,-0.0014380453,-0.0147708645,-0.022558643,0.019599013,-0.019285321,-0.003092607,-0.0036177025,-0.010767865,0.030551003,-0.017839603,0.018562462,0.00044752445,-0.00093681784,-0.007549098,-0.0063488805,-0.005107746,-0.0020645794,-0.0032665024,0.015739221,-0.0068023717,0.017798686,0.013495632,0.028068734,0.022626836,0.010761045,0.0037268132,-0.006713719,-0.0022248358,-0.012650024,-0.011217946,-0.009901798,0.030278226,0.030551003,-0.014743587,-0.007235405,-0.021358425,0.012397706,0.0037131743,-0.017430438,0.02130387,0.00049142446,-0.010201853,-0.010181394,0.004773594,-0.03668848,0.010283685,0.009629021,-0.019448986,-0.013938895,0.010385977,0.00976541,0.0053737033,0.0064170742,0.0059567634,0.006655754,0.0028743856,0.022640476,-0.010045006,0.01164757,-0.0149345305,-0.02082651,-0.0044189845,0.008326512,0.0015804006,0.0009794392,0.0033023043,0.013086467,0.018276047,0.00058561773,0.019053461,0.0012505112,0.010447352,0.008428804,0.020662844,-0.0056294315,0.016543914,-0.012090832,0.0030636245,-0.00423486,0